WEBVTT

01:49.420 --> 01:54.990
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.030 --> 01:57.990
[Episode 23]

01:59.400 --> 02:01.060
So you plan to frame me.

02:01.310 --> 02:02.400
How clever.

02:03.040 --> 02:03.900
You flatter me.

02:04.430 --> 02:07.040
I've just been dealing with
Your Highness too long

02:07.040 --> 02:08.240
and picked up a few tricks.

02:08.240 --> 02:09.500
I'm just fighting fire

02:09.910 --> 02:11.750
with fire.

02:13.150 --> 02:15.150
Mr. Chu, since you understand that,

02:15.520 --> 02:16.910
do you also know

02:17.400 --> 02:18.190
I could

02:19.079 --> 02:20.520
make a clean getaway?

02:25.240 --> 02:26.240
Nightwalkers,

02:26.430 --> 02:28.290
leave Waning River Crescent now.

02:34.180 --> 02:40.310
[Big Fortune]

02:48.870 --> 02:49.710
Nan Heng,

02:50.060 --> 02:50.870
I will find proof

02:50.870 --> 02:53.470
that you're colluding
with the Nightwalkers.

02:54.150 --> 02:55.960
General Chu, you must be joking.

02:57.240 --> 02:59.750
I'm here today because you invited me.

03:00.030 --> 03:02.910
What does that have to do
with Waning River Crescent?

03:02.910 --> 03:03.960
Or are you saying

03:04.310 --> 03:06.280
you brought me here on purpose

03:07.240 --> 03:09.590
just so you could frame me
for helping from the inside

03:09.590 --> 03:11.790
and using the chaos
to bust someone out?

03:12.750 --> 03:14.470
Right after you entered
the celestial prison,

03:14.470 --> 03:16.070
there was a prison break.

03:16.150 --> 03:17.470
Was that just a coincidence?

03:17.470 --> 03:19.000
I'm puzzled about that too.

03:19.430 --> 03:22.030
How did the thugs know I'd be here?

03:22.520 --> 03:23.480
Besides,

03:24.750 --> 03:26.520
I was injured here, wasn't I?

03:27.590 --> 03:28.560
Could it be that

03:28.870 --> 03:31.600
there's a mole in your Qianyu Army
or in the office

03:32.110 --> 03:33.640
of the capital prefecture?

03:34.120 --> 03:35.040
Nan Heng,

03:35.310 --> 03:36.240
that's slander!

03:36.240 --> 03:37.280
You spoke out of turn

03:37.280 --> 03:38.360
and framed a prince.

03:38.360 --> 03:39.620
That's unforgivable!

03:39.870 --> 03:41.560
You even set trap after trap

03:41.750 --> 03:44.350
to take down both
Waning River Crescent and me.

03:45.680 --> 03:48.030
Your crimes are really numerous.

03:48.800 --> 03:49.710
However,

03:50.150 --> 03:52.150
you still don't know me well enough.

03:52.390 --> 03:53.920
You call me the God of Death,

03:54.400 --> 03:55.800
so why would someone like that

03:55.800 --> 03:57.700
hesitate to take a life?

03:59.310 --> 04:01.870
If Shangguan He really worked for me,

04:03.310 --> 04:04.960
why would I have let him live?

04:05.680 --> 04:07.310
Why didn't I kill him

04:07.310 --> 04:08.590
during the chaos just now?

04:08.590 --> 04:10.180
Why would I bother

04:10.360 --> 04:11.910
having people disguised as thugs

04:11.910 --> 04:13.120
to rescue him?

04:19.570 --> 04:22.170
Shangguan He's sentencing
is still days away.

04:22.310 --> 04:24.430
I don't believe
his accomplices will sit still

04:24.430 --> 04:25.480
and just watch.

04:26.240 --> 04:27.370
If they make a move,

04:27.810 --> 04:29.630
they're bound to slip up.

04:33.680 --> 04:36.140
If you ask me,
the one who can't sit still here

04:37.159 --> 04:39.070
is you, General Chu.

04:43.800 --> 04:44.600
Yimeng.

04:45.480 --> 04:46.270
Father.

04:47.560 --> 04:48.510
How is she?

04:48.950 --> 04:50.270
The physician said it's nothing serious.

04:50.270 --> 04:52.070
She just needs a few days of rest.

04:52.070 --> 04:52.870
Don't worry.

04:54.750 --> 04:55.560
Father,

04:55.920 --> 04:56.920
where is Nan Heng?

04:57.310 --> 04:58.909
Is he still in Yiting's room?

04:59.630 --> 05:00.720
He's already left.

05:01.060 --> 05:02.190
I'll go check on her.

05:05.510 --> 05:07.120
Not right now.

05:07.310 --> 05:08.340
Yiting said

05:08.600 --> 05:10.560
she doesn't want
to see anyone at the moment.

05:10.560 --> 05:11.560
Why not?

05:11.800 --> 05:12.940
She wants to see Nan Heng

05:12.940 --> 05:14.470
but not us?

05:16.430 --> 05:18.750
That Seventh Prince is so manipulative,

05:19.280 --> 05:21.610
making your sister fall so deeply for him.

05:25.750 --> 05:26.950
Don't worry, Father.

05:27.270 --> 05:29.040
I'll never let Nan Heng

05:29.110 --> 05:30.440
hurt Song Yiting again.

05:32.150 --> 05:33.800
His Majesty has arrived!

05:37.600 --> 05:38.750
Greetings, Mr. Song.

05:38.750 --> 05:39.630
Eunuch Liu.

05:40.510 --> 05:42.000
I didn't know His Majesty was coming.

05:42.000 --> 05:43.680
Forgive me for not receiving him properly.

05:43.680 --> 05:45.330
No need for such formalities, Mr. Song.

05:45.330 --> 05:47.040
His Majesty is visiting

05:47.040 --> 05:48.480
in disguise.

05:48.480 --> 05:50.280
He's not here for state affairs.

05:51.400 --> 05:53.000
Then may I ask what matter

05:53.000 --> 05:54.659
has brought His Majesty here?

05:54.760 --> 05:56.770
Mr. Song, no need to pretend.

05:57.010 --> 05:59.510
The Eighteenth Prince
has gone to His Majesty

05:59.510 --> 06:02.170
and reported
the Seventh Prince's misconduct.

06:02.230 --> 06:03.720
Then I should go see His Majesty at once.

06:03.720 --> 06:04.920
Don't rush, Mr. Song.

06:05.510 --> 06:07.510
The person His Majesty wishes to see

06:07.560 --> 06:08.630
is not you.

06:09.310 --> 06:10.310
Not me?

06:10.830 --> 06:11.870
Then who is it?

06:19.000 --> 06:19.800
Me?

06:25.000 --> 06:26.000
Your Majesty,

06:26.000 --> 06:27.270
Song Yimeng is here.

06:37.750 --> 06:38.870
I'm Song Yimeng.

06:38.950 --> 06:40.409
Greetings, Your Majesty.

06:51.420 --> 06:52.790
I'm Song Yimeng.

06:53.310 --> 06:54.770
Greetings, Your Majesty.

07:05.660 --> 07:09.240
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

07:21.920 --> 07:22.780
Your Highness,

07:22.920 --> 07:24.510
all Nightwalkers are gone.

07:24.720 --> 07:27.180
The Qianyu Army got there
and found nothing.

07:27.190 --> 07:28.000
Good.

07:28.560 --> 07:30.750
I was worried about that on my way here.

07:34.520 --> 07:35.390
What's wrong?

07:36.040 --> 07:36.720
Your Highness,

07:36.720 --> 07:37.909
something terrible has happened.

07:37.909 --> 07:39.480
The Eighteenth Prince
went to see His Majesty

07:39.480 --> 07:40.430
and reported you

07:40.430 --> 07:41.760
because of Song Yiting.

07:42.040 --> 07:43.159
What did His Majesty say?

07:43.159 --> 07:44.310
His Majesty was furious.

07:44.310 --> 07:45.970
He kept scolding Song Yimeng.

07:46.170 --> 07:48.070
Why was he scolding Song Yimeng?

07:48.159 --> 07:49.040
H-He said

07:49.040 --> 07:51.550
Song Yimeng shouldn't
have brought you, a terribl…

07:51.550 --> 07:52.750
a terribly wise man,

07:52.750 --> 07:55.430
into the Song Residence.

07:55.430 --> 07:57.360
That's what caused all this mess.

07:57.380 --> 07:59.190
He also said she acts improperly

07:59.450 --> 08:00.390
and lacks feminine virtues.

08:00.390 --> 08:02.000
Song Yiting followed her example

08:02.000 --> 08:04.720
and became the wild,
unruly girl she is now.

08:05.830 --> 08:08.240
His Majesty scolded Song Yimeng,

08:08.750 --> 08:10.390
but the one he resents is me.

08:10.430 --> 08:11.480
Your Highness,

08:11.630 --> 08:13.480
His Majesty is really angry this time.

08:13.480 --> 08:15.720
He couldn't even wait
to summon Song Yimeng to court

08:15.720 --> 08:17.190
and personally went to the Song Residence

08:17.190 --> 08:18.880
to teach her a lesson.

08:24.630 --> 08:25.680
Eunuch Liu.

08:27.920 --> 08:29.720
Why did His Majesty

08:30.510 --> 08:31.680
summon me today?

08:33.419 --> 08:36.480
His Majesty condescended
to visit the Song Residence.

08:36.510 --> 08:38.909
What do you think it's for?

08:39.870 --> 08:42.140
The Emperor has always despised Nan Heng.

08:42.140 --> 08:44.330
Could it be that he plans
to use the Zijin Pavilion incident

08:44.330 --> 08:45.790
to charge him with a crime?

08:46.320 --> 08:47.240
If I tell him everything

08:47.240 --> 08:50.070
about Nan Heng secretly seeking
the method of weapon forging,

08:50.070 --> 08:51.410
maybe I can stop

08:51.720 --> 08:53.270
what's about to happen.

08:54.020 --> 08:55.600
The Song family wouldn't be wiped out,

08:55.600 --> 08:57.360
Yiting wouldn't be deceived,

08:57.440 --> 08:59.040
and I wouldn't be mutilated.

08:59.390 --> 09:00.200
Should I

09:00.550 --> 09:01.750
expose him?

09:05.600 --> 09:07.050
If I explained it to you,

09:07.550 --> 09:08.750
would you believe me?

09:11.910 --> 09:13.640
People call me the God of Death.

09:14.120 --> 09:15.780
Isn't that what you think too?

09:16.070 --> 09:17.840
The world insults and curses me.

09:17.840 --> 09:19.300
Haven't you done the same?

09:20.240 --> 09:21.910
It's true that I don't trust anyone.

09:21.910 --> 09:23.550
That's because no one's ever trusted me.

09:23.550 --> 09:25.040
Not even you!

09:25.130 --> 09:26.000
You need to understand—

09:26.000 --> 09:27.030
things in this world

09:27.030 --> 09:28.120
aren't always

09:28.120 --> 09:29.120
what they seem.

09:29.120 --> 09:30.750
If I didn't fight to survive,

09:30.750 --> 09:32.880
then I'd be the one forced to a dead end.

09:38.440 --> 09:39.240
Your Majesty.

09:45.960 --> 09:47.360
I've already heard about

09:47.390 --> 09:48.850
what happened last night.

09:49.080 --> 09:49.990
Song Yimeng,

09:50.510 --> 09:51.880
if you testify

09:52.040 --> 09:54.010
that Heng seduced your sister

09:54.360 --> 09:55.890
and has poor moral conduct…

09:55.960 --> 09:56.760
Your Majesty,

09:57.360 --> 09:58.320
I don't want

09:58.630 --> 10:00.520
to testify against the Seventh Prince.

10:00.520 --> 10:02.180
I just want an imperial edict.

10:03.310 --> 10:05.650
You just want me to back you up

10:06.000 --> 10:09.400
to secure your position
as the principal consort, don't you?

10:13.150 --> 10:13.960
Fine then.

10:14.030 --> 10:15.150
On the ninth day of next month,

10:15.150 --> 10:16.610
you'll marry Heng.

10:16.790 --> 10:17.600
The next day,

10:17.840 --> 10:20.700
Song Yiting will join
the household as a concubine.

10:20.960 --> 10:21.480
Your Majesty…

10:21.480 --> 10:22.550
I'm not finished.

10:26.150 --> 10:27.720
The scandal between you Song sisters

10:27.720 --> 10:28.790
and Heng

10:28.790 --> 10:30.150
has already stirred up

10:30.150 --> 10:31.240
quite a storm.

10:31.440 --> 10:34.030
Song Yude's reputation
has taken a huge hit.

10:34.120 --> 10:36.600
He likely won't be able to stay
in the capital anymore.

10:36.600 --> 10:39.480
I'll advise him to resign and retire

10:39.630 --> 10:41.750
and serve as a retainer under Heng,

10:42.030 --> 10:44.030
following him to his fief.

10:44.480 --> 10:45.280
Your Majesty,

10:45.390 --> 10:46.520
that's not the edict

10:46.610 --> 10:47.720
I want to ask for.

10:47.720 --> 10:48.480
You wouldn't testify

10:48.480 --> 10:49.890
or get married.

10:50.030 --> 10:51.670
What more do you want?

10:52.670 --> 10:55.130
Do you really think
I'd hesitate to kill you?

10:57.510 --> 10:58.320
Your Majesty,

10:59.360 --> 11:00.510
what I'm asking for

11:01.350 --> 11:05.150
is an imperial edict to call off
my engagement to the Seventh Prince.

11:05.440 --> 11:06.240
Neither I,

11:06.600 --> 11:07.840
nor my sister,

11:08.240 --> 11:09.700
nor the entire Song family

11:10.510 --> 11:13.320
wishes to have anything to do
with the Seventh Prince.

11:13.320 --> 11:14.290
Song Yimeng,

11:14.910 --> 11:16.230
a prince's marriage

11:16.250 --> 11:17.200
is both a family matter

11:17.200 --> 11:18.260
and a state affair.

11:18.670 --> 11:20.320
It's not a children's game

11:20.440 --> 11:21.670
where you can change

11:21.750 --> 11:24.240
your mind at will.

11:25.270 --> 11:26.250
If you

11:27.030 --> 11:28.320
can't give

11:28.510 --> 11:30.240
a legitimate reason…

11:30.550 --> 11:31.360
Your Majesty,

11:31.750 --> 11:33.480
if the engagement is canceled,

11:33.670 --> 11:35.390
the Seventh Prince can never

11:35.390 --> 11:37.710
pull the Ministry of War to his side.

11:38.360 --> 11:39.320
That'll

11:39.670 --> 11:41.240
buy you enough time

11:41.750 --> 11:43.150
to plan the path forward

11:43.440 --> 11:45.040
for the future crown prince.

11:46.200 --> 11:48.060
Whether to marry the Song sisters

11:48.400 --> 11:49.670
to the Seventh Prince

11:50.280 --> 11:51.770
or cancel the engagement—

11:52.600 --> 11:53.550
the pros and cons

11:55.100 --> 11:56.900
are worth your careful thought.

12:03.550 --> 12:04.420
I really did

12:05.910 --> 12:07.750
underestimate you.

12:11.150 --> 12:12.720
But I must warn you,

12:13.480 --> 12:14.240
Heng

12:14.550 --> 12:17.150
has worked hard to secure this marriage.

12:18.080 --> 12:19.810
If you turn your back on him now,

12:19.970 --> 12:21.720
he'll never let you

12:22.480 --> 12:24.210
or the Song family off the hook.

12:44.120 --> 12:45.580
I've been looking for you.

12:52.330 --> 12:53.450
I knew you'd come.

13:00.080 --> 13:00.870
What is it?

13:03.120 --> 13:04.580
This is the imperial edict

13:04.830 --> 13:06.450
calling off our engagement.

13:09.080 --> 13:10.680
Calling off the engagement?

13:19.630 --> 13:20.590
Song Yimeng.

13:21.550 --> 13:22.600
I told you

13:22.600 --> 13:23.480
I'd explain to you

13:23.480 --> 13:25.340
what happened at Zijin Pavilion.

13:25.720 --> 13:27.510
Why won't you trust me?

13:27.720 --> 13:28.960
Not even once?

13:31.150 --> 13:32.950
What do you expect me to believe?

13:33.320 --> 13:34.720
That you didn't

13:34.720 --> 13:36.180
approach me from the start

13:37.030 --> 13:39.230
for the sake of the Song family's power?

13:39.750 --> 13:41.240
Or that you're not someone

13:41.670 --> 13:43.550
who schemes,

13:43.570 --> 13:44.900
plays political games,

13:45.550 --> 13:46.960
and never repents?

13:56.110 --> 13:56.990
So,

14:00.000 --> 14:01.120
in your eyes,

14:02.320 --> 14:03.920
everything between your sister and me

14:03.920 --> 14:06.360
was just a calculated move
to win over the Song family.

14:06.360 --> 14:11.860
♪ I leave the book aside,
though I haven't finished reading it ♪

14:07.790 --> 14:08.720
Every time you were in danger

14:08.720 --> 14:10.000
and I helped you,

14:10.000 --> 14:11.480
I was pretending to care.

14:13.360 --> 14:15.680
Everything I did for you

14:15.300 --> 14:21.040
♪ I know one day I can have
a glimpse of the ending ♪

14:16.730 --> 14:17.730
was…

14:19.240 --> 14:20.800
was meaningless,

14:20.840 --> 14:22.240
and you see no value in it.

14:23.060 --> 14:23.850
Is that it?

14:24.120 --> 14:28.190
♪ Life is unpredictable ♪

14:28.630 --> 14:29.770
Why?

14:29.180 --> 14:32.000
♪ Who can get rid of perplexity ♪

14:30.930 --> 14:32.890
Why do you think you know me so well?

14:32.970 --> 14:37.570
♪ And find the answer he yearns for? ♪

14:35.500 --> 14:37.420
Because I already knew you

14:37.590 --> 14:39.230
before I even met you!

14:41.710 --> 14:44.860
♪ Let the wind flip through
the past chapters of my life ♪

14:45.870 --> 14:46.720
I see.

14:46.280 --> 14:49.250
♪ Let brush and ink
depict my adventures ♪

14:50.360 --> 14:51.160
The script.

14:50.630 --> 14:57.200
♪ Let's see in how many ways
fate can shape my life ♪

14:53.470 --> 14:54.470
And those…

14:56.160 --> 14:56.950
rules,

14:57.420 --> 14:58.210
right?

14:59.460 --> 15:00.880
But let me tell you something.

14:59.710 --> 15:03.150
♪ Let moonlight shine on
the lines about love and hate ♪

15:02.170 --> 15:03.600
I'm a real, living person.

15:03.600 --> 15:05.360
I'm standing right here.

15:04.150 --> 15:07.710
♪ Let me bang my head
against a brick wall ♪

15:06.170 --> 15:07.240
I'm standing right here,

15:07.240 --> 15:08.360
but you choose to look away

15:08.360 --> 15:10.270
and believe some absurd script!

15:08.490 --> 15:14.720
♪ If this is my destiny,
I'll accept it ♪

15:10.270 --> 15:11.070
That's right.

15:11.510 --> 15:12.870
I don't trust you.

15:13.320 --> 15:14.480
Not just this time,

15:14.910 --> 15:15.870
from now on,

15:16.320 --> 15:17.960
I'll never trust you again.

15:18.510 --> 15:20.200
Let me tell you something, Nan Heng.

15:20.200 --> 15:21.670
From the very start,

15:21.670 --> 15:23.930
I got close to you
just so I could kill you.

15:24.150 --> 15:25.870
Seeking the method of weapon forging,

15:25.870 --> 15:27.320
the Lantern Festival,

15:27.320 --> 15:30.250
and even the engagement—
all calculated to kill you!

15:30.970 --> 15:34.240
♪ Wind, be with me
in the quest for an ideal ♪

15:33.480 --> 15:35.670
If Yiting didn't have feelings for you,

15:35.260 --> 15:38.300
♪ Brush and ink,
stand with me on the cliff ♪

15:37.440 --> 15:39.480
I'd very much like to kill you now.

15:39.720 --> 15:46.100
♪ My heart measures
the waves I've cleaved ♪

15:48.640 --> 15:52.090
♪ Setting sun, help me
weather through the big snow ♪

15:53.090 --> 15:56.690
♪ I'll wait till the next chapter
to get sorrowful ♪

15:58.130 --> 16:04.330
♪ Every word resonates with me
like dancing notes on the paper ♪

16:20.240 --> 16:23.810
♪ Wind, be with me
in the quest for an ideal ♪

16:24.720 --> 16:27.690
♪ Brush and ink,
stand with me on the cliff ♪

16:29.260 --> 16:35.610
♪ My heart measures
the waves I've cleaved ♪

16:38.250 --> 16:41.490
♪ Setting sun, help me
weather through the big snow ♪

16:42.480 --> 16:46.930
♪ I'll wait till the next chapter
to get sorrowful ♪

16:49.340 --> 16:57.170
♪ Every word resonates with me
like dancing notes on the paper ♪

17:08.880 --> 17:11.230
[Imperial Edict]

17:12.589 --> 17:13.400
Song Yimeng,

17:13.829 --> 17:15.359
how could you be so foolish?

17:15.599 --> 17:17.790
The Seventh Prince
has promised to take care of everything.

17:17.790 --> 17:20.050
Why did you have to break the engagement?

17:21.109 --> 17:22.720
I never had feelings for him.

17:23.200 --> 17:24.640
Why couldn't I end it?

17:27.510 --> 17:28.349
I know

17:28.510 --> 17:30.680
you're caught up
in your emotions right now.

17:30.680 --> 17:31.920
No matter what I say

17:31.920 --> 17:32.960
to convince you to leave him,

17:32.960 --> 17:34.220
you won't listen to me.

17:34.960 --> 17:35.830
But Yiting,

17:36.000 --> 17:37.440
I still have to say this—

17:37.740 --> 17:39.440
I know what kind of person he is.

17:39.440 --> 17:40.700
That man is…

17:41.030 --> 17:42.640
It won't end well for you two.

17:43.300 --> 17:45.630
The one who doesn't really
know him is you.

17:46.750 --> 17:48.080
I'll be honest with you.

17:48.880 --> 17:50.160
The one I love

17:50.480 --> 17:51.480
is Shangguan He.

17:52.750 --> 17:54.640
Everything that happened at Zijin Pavilion

17:54.640 --> 17:56.380
was just a misunderstanding.

17:56.750 --> 17:58.510
You love Shangguan He?

18:00.750 --> 18:01.790
Then why would you and Nan…

18:01.790 --> 18:02.550
Song Yimeng,

18:02.640 --> 18:04.170
how could you be so foolish?

18:04.680 --> 18:05.920
You spend every day with

18:05.920 --> 18:07.240
the Seventh Prince and Li Shiliu,

18:07.240 --> 18:08.900
but you never once thought about

18:08.900 --> 18:10.720
who you truly care for.

18:11.590 --> 18:12.820
What…

18:13.400 --> 18:15.600
What does this have to do with Li Shiliu?

18:25.040 --> 18:26.770
Madam, as you instructed,

18:26.860 --> 18:29.110
I never told anyone that
Miss Yiting had feelings

18:29.110 --> 18:30.430
for Li Shiliu.

18:32.240 --> 18:34.150
The whole city is talking about

18:34.240 --> 18:36.110
Yiting and the Seventh Prince now.

18:36.110 --> 18:36.830
The last thing we want

18:36.830 --> 18:39.360
is to involve someone
from the martial world.

18:39.510 --> 18:40.310
Yes.

18:40.680 --> 18:41.750
Yiting

18:42.280 --> 18:43.810
has feelings for Li Shiliu?

18:44.680 --> 18:45.650
Song Yimeng,

18:45.790 --> 18:47.430
how could you be so foolish?

18:47.550 --> 18:48.830
You spend every day with

18:48.830 --> 18:50.110
the Seventh Prince and Li Shiliu,

18:50.110 --> 18:51.790
but you never once thought about

18:51.790 --> 18:53.640
who you truly care for.

18:58.740 --> 19:00.470
[Nan Heng] [Li Shiliu]

19:00.090 --> 19:01.490
Could it be that Li Shiliu

19:00.470 --> 19:04.210
[Slacker Escape Plan]

19:01.920 --> 19:03.750
has some connection to Nan Heng?

19:07.870 --> 19:11.040
[Nan Heng]

19:11.040 --> 19:14.830
[Li Shiliu]

19:14.870 --> 19:18.670
[Slacker Escape Plan]

19:18.690 --> 19:21.820
[Nan Heng] [Li Shiliu]

19:22.120 --> 19:24.440
Everyone has their reasons
for what they do,

19:24.440 --> 19:25.480
but when things go wrong,

19:25.480 --> 19:26.720
it must be Nan Heng's fault.

19:26.720 --> 19:27.790
So in your heart,

19:27.790 --> 19:29.030
Nan Heng harms people,

19:29.030 --> 19:30.270
while Chu Guihong saves people.

19:30.270 --> 19:31.550
Nan Heng is selfish,

19:31.550 --> 19:33.950
while Chu Guihong
is devoted to the people.

19:34.070 --> 19:35.830
After all this, you still see Nan Heng

19:35.830 --> 19:37.030
the same way?

19:37.080 --> 19:38.240
From what I see,

19:38.270 --> 19:39.400
Nan Heng truly cares about you.

19:39.400 --> 19:41.010
How could he possibly want to kill you?

19:40.940 --> 19:43.360
[Slacker Escape Plan]

19:41.670 --> 19:43.800
Why is Li Shiliu
always defending Nan Heng?

19:43.800 --> 19:44.780
Could it be…

19:46.240 --> 19:48.240
I was wrong from the very beginning?

19:51.950 --> 19:58.790
[Iconic Scenes in the Script]

19:52.400 --> 19:54.160
Rescue in the pool of the royal garden.

19:54.160 --> 19:55.760
Falling out with her family.

19:56.270 --> 19:59.600
The affair between the sister-in-law
and brother-in-law.

20:00.920 --> 20:07.350
[Iconic Scenes in the Script]

20:01.830 --> 20:03.970
All these iconic scenes have happened.

20:03.970 --> 20:05.650
And Nan Heng was in all of them.

20:05.790 --> 20:07.320
The only thing that changed

20:07.790 --> 20:09.470
was what happened
during the Lantern Festival.

20:09.470 --> 20:11.540
[2: Saving the Girl
during the Lantern Festival]

20:14.400 --> 20:16.860
The one who saved me
that day wasn't Nan Heng.

20:21.480 --> 20:22.790
It was Li Shiliu.

20:25.600 --> 20:26.560
Maybe

20:27.230 --> 20:28.840
Li Shiliu didn't save me

20:29.750 --> 20:31.720
because he wanted to

20:32.450 --> 20:33.550
but because

20:34.240 --> 20:36.370
whenever the female lead is in danger…

20:41.400 --> 20:42.640
the male lead must save her.

20:42.640 --> 20:43.440
15 minutes.

20:43.440 --> 20:45.440
Don't kill her until I'm far enough.

20:56.770 --> 20:58.350
In the original script,

20:59.110 --> 21:02.750
Song Yimeng fell for Nan Heng

21:03.220 --> 21:04.620
and was smitten with him.

21:04.920 --> 21:06.400
But after I came here,

21:07.530 --> 21:09.360
the one she fell for is…

21:14.150 --> 21:16.270
The script never mentioned

21:16.310 --> 21:18.210
that the fireworks in this world

21:18.350 --> 21:19.670
would be so beautiful.

21:20.880 --> 21:22.070
And

21:22.640 --> 21:24.180
it never said…

21:29.240 --> 21:31.370
that the masked supporting character

21:31.400 --> 21:32.740
would be so charming.

21:36.240 --> 21:37.230
So tell me,

21:37.370 --> 21:38.650
what are we

21:39.200 --> 21:40.200
to each other now?

21:56.660 --> 21:57.670
So,

21:59.210 --> 22:01.680
the script never changed at all.

22:03.010 --> 22:04.370
The one I love

22:07.300 --> 22:08.460
is Li Shiliu…

22:15.460 --> 22:16.920
and also Nan Heng.

22:42.270 --> 22:44.840
[Wanted Notice
from Capital Prefecture's Office]

22:42.770 --> 22:45.200
Li Shiliu, the head
of Waning River Crescent,

22:45.200 --> 22:46.830
is hiding a death row convict.

22:46.830 --> 22:49.330
We're to search the entire city
for him and his accomplices.

22:49.330 --> 22:56.560
[Wanted Notice
from Capital Prefecture's Office]

22:49.400 --> 22:51.420
Anyone who reports or turns them in

22:51.550 --> 22:53.350
will be rewarded based on merit.

22:53.440 --> 22:54.720
Anyone who helps

22:55.350 --> 22:56.400
or hides them

22:57.030 --> 22:58.960
will be punished as an accomplice.

23:01.850 --> 23:03.000
This place is quite secluded.

23:03.000 --> 23:04.660
We can hide here for a few days.

23:04.790 --> 23:05.270
Come,

23:05.270 --> 23:06.280
give me a hand.

23:13.070 --> 23:13.800
Who's there?

23:15.310 --> 23:15.920
It's me.

23:22.520 --> 23:23.450
-Chief.
-Chief.

23:25.110 --> 23:26.260
Chief. Chief. Chief.

23:26.260 --> 23:27.480
Chief. Chief. Chief.

23:27.510 --> 23:28.710
Chief. Chief. Chief.

23:28.880 --> 23:29.550
How's everything?

23:29.550 --> 23:30.550
Is everyone okay?

23:30.680 --> 23:31.550
No one is hurt.

23:32.720 --> 23:34.830
The others are hiding next door.

23:35.200 --> 23:36.000
Good.

23:36.440 --> 23:37.240
Chief,

23:37.350 --> 23:39.920
thank God you sent
someone to warn us that day.

23:40.030 --> 23:41.240
Otherwise, we really would've

23:41.240 --> 23:42.680
broken into the prison.

23:43.480 --> 23:44.440
I never expected

23:44.440 --> 23:46.240
it was all Chu Guihong's trap.

23:46.240 --> 23:47.200
How vicious.

23:47.550 --> 23:48.350
We need to save

23:48.350 --> 23:49.210
Second Master.

23:51.680 --> 23:52.680
Don't worry about

23:53.440 --> 23:54.350
Shangguan He.

23:57.750 --> 23:59.680
Today, I'm announcing something.

24:00.320 --> 24:02.520
From this day on, Waning River Crescent

24:03.070 --> 24:04.530
is officially disbanded.

24:04.790 --> 24:05.750
What?

24:05.750 --> 24:06.480
Disbanded?

24:06.480 --> 24:07.200
Why?

24:07.200 --> 24:07.960
Yeah,

24:07.960 --> 24:08.930
how can that be?

24:12.160 --> 24:13.030
No way, Chief.

24:13.080 --> 24:14.550
You've gotta be kidding.

24:19.160 --> 24:20.210
Take this money.

24:20.830 --> 24:21.640
Take it.

24:22.480 --> 24:23.880
Split it among everyone.

24:24.440 --> 24:25.310
As for the rest,

24:25.440 --> 24:26.270
don't ask.

24:26.550 --> 24:27.350
Chief,

24:28.160 --> 24:30.270
are you sending us away

24:30.290 --> 24:31.820
to rescue Shangguan alone?

24:33.070 --> 24:34.670
That's none of your concern.

24:35.350 --> 24:36.160
Wait.

24:38.480 --> 24:39.880
This money isn't enough.

24:43.400 --> 24:44.200
That's right.

24:44.430 --> 24:46.550
We've risked our lives
for you all these years,

24:46.550 --> 24:47.350
and you think a little money like this

24:47.350 --> 24:48.510
is enough to get rid of us?

24:48.510 --> 24:49.530
No way.

24:49.680 --> 24:50.400
Right, guys?

24:50.400 --> 24:51.030
That's right.

24:51.030 --> 24:52.350
You promised to find me a wife.

24:52.350 --> 24:53.460
Until you do, I'm not going anywhere!

24:53.460 --> 24:54.270
Yeah!

24:54.270 --> 24:55.640
And my mom's house—

24:55.640 --> 24:56.480
you haven't bought it for me yet!

24:56.480 --> 24:57.000
Exactly!

24:57.000 --> 24:57.400
You promised.

24:57.400 --> 24:58.070
Shut up!

25:04.680 --> 25:06.080
Right now the Qianyu Army

25:06.350 --> 25:08.350
is hunting down every Nightwalker.

25:08.400 --> 25:10.430
If you stay in the capital,
you'll be in danger everywhere you go.

25:10.430 --> 25:11.270
Do as I say—

25:11.270 --> 25:12.000
leave, now.

25:14.160 --> 25:14.960
Chief,

25:14.960 --> 25:15.790
I know

25:15.850 --> 25:17.110
you want to risk everything alone

25:17.110 --> 25:18.350
and push us all far away,

25:18.350 --> 25:19.030
right?

25:19.350 --> 25:20.500
Dream on.

25:20.680 --> 25:21.720
We Nightwalkers

25:21.720 --> 25:23.130
are not afraid of death.

25:23.550 --> 25:24.440
If we live, we live together.

25:24.440 --> 25:25.900
If we die, we die together.

25:26.000 --> 25:26.790
Chief,

25:26.950 --> 25:28.030
back when we joined you,

25:28.030 --> 25:29.070
didn't we say

25:29.070 --> 25:31.090
the Nightwalkers live and die as one?

25:31.090 --> 25:32.400
Yeah, we live and die as one!

25:32.400 --> 25:32.920
That's right.

25:32.920 --> 25:34.800
We live and die as one!

25:36.790 --> 25:37.790
The Nightwalkers

25:38.200 --> 25:39.200
aren't a family

25:39.550 --> 25:40.680
without you, Chief.

25:42.960 --> 25:44.620
We live and die as one.

25:44.750 --> 25:46.480
That's what makes us brothers.

25:57.200 --> 25:58.400
We live and die as one?

26:04.270 --> 26:06.610
You're just street rats—

26:07.940 --> 26:10.070
nobodies from the martial arts world.

26:20.270 --> 26:22.730
You think you deserve
to live and die with me?

26:24.420 --> 26:25.410
Seventh Prince?

26:28.030 --> 26:29.430
Let me be honest with you.

26:31.240 --> 26:32.500
Waning River Crescent

26:33.160 --> 26:34.160
is nothing more than

26:34.160 --> 26:36.750
a chess piece I placed in the capital.

26:37.920 --> 26:38.970
And you?

26:39.640 --> 26:41.790
You're all just pawns.

26:43.120 --> 26:45.980
Now that Shangguan He's identity
has been exposed,

26:46.590 --> 26:48.790
all of you have become stains on my name.

26:49.450 --> 26:50.980
Have I made it clear enough?

27:04.350 --> 27:05.310
100 taels.

27:06.700 --> 27:08.550
It's more than enough
to last you for a lifetime.

27:08.550 --> 27:09.540
Did you hear me?

27:09.750 --> 27:11.280
Take the money and get lost.

27:13.590 --> 27:14.270
Chief…

27:14.270 --> 27:14.960
Shut up!

27:18.460 --> 27:20.390
Who are you to call me your brother?

27:25.740 --> 27:26.530
And you,

27:29.680 --> 27:32.150
a good-for-nothing
who can't even speak properly.

27:32.150 --> 27:33.550
What use do I have for you?

27:34.610 --> 27:36.350
And the rest of you rabble,

27:37.680 --> 27:38.680
listen up.

27:39.450 --> 27:40.880
If one day

27:41.270 --> 27:42.880
you wreck my plans,

27:44.860 --> 27:46.660
none of you will walk away alive.

27:48.340 --> 27:49.240
Did you hear me?

29:05.970 --> 29:06.970
Chief.

29:10.590 --> 29:11.510
Let's drink our fill tonight.

29:11.510 --> 29:12.510
Yeah.

29:13.270 --> 29:13.960
Come on.

29:13.960 --> 29:14.680
Bottoms up!

29:14.970 --> 29:15.790
Fill it up.

29:15.790 --> 29:16.510
Come on.

29:16.510 --> 29:17.270
Fill it up.

29:17.270 --> 29:17.920
Good.

29:17.920 --> 29:19.450
Here's your wine. Drink up!

29:20.440 --> 29:21.110
Cheers.

29:21.110 --> 29:22.110
You must finish it all.

29:22.110 --> 29:22.570
Come on.

29:22.760 --> 29:23.310
Here.

29:23.310 --> 29:24.250
Here's to you.

29:24.750 --> 29:25.480
Come on.

29:25.480 --> 29:26.000
Chief,

29:26.000 --> 29:27.120
here's to you.

29:27.240 --> 29:28.030
Drink.

29:28.720 --> 29:29.660
Drink up, drink up.

29:29.660 --> 29:30.580
Come on.

29:32.640 --> 29:33.710
Second Master.

29:33.880 --> 29:34.740
Second Master.

29:34.790 --> 29:35.670
Second Master.

29:35.830 --> 29:36.690
Second Master.

29:37.830 --> 29:39.640
Come on, drink.

29:41.790 --> 29:43.000
You two, come here.

29:43.000 --> 29:44.160
Drink up.

29:45.350 --> 29:46.110
Drink up.

30:32.270 --> 30:33.220
Chief,

30:34.550 --> 30:35.950
do you remember a year ago

30:36.440 --> 30:37.480
when you told me

30:37.500 --> 30:39.460
to run Waning River Crescent for you?

30:39.460 --> 30:41.070
We agreed then that

30:41.070 --> 30:42.270
you'd be the cold-hearted Chief,

30:42.270 --> 30:43.550
and I'd be the cold-hearted Second Master,

30:43.550 --> 30:45.680
doing all the dirty work you couldn't.

30:45.750 --> 30:46.480
So why is it now

30:46.480 --> 30:48.610
I'm out there giving disaster relief,

30:48.640 --> 30:49.930
fighting floods,

30:50.070 --> 30:51.240
handing alms to the weak,

30:51.240 --> 30:53.170
and even looking for missing cats?

30:57.400 --> 30:58.700
I sent you to do a few good deeds

30:58.700 --> 31:00.640
so you, a sinner, could earn yourself

31:00.640 --> 31:01.800
some good karma.

31:02.070 --> 31:03.120
Get it?

31:03.160 --> 31:04.550
A few good deeds?

31:04.550 --> 31:05.880
It's been a few hundred already.

31:05.880 --> 31:06.640
Chief,

31:06.640 --> 31:08.440
open your eyes and look at us.

31:08.510 --> 31:09.920
You're a viper,

31:09.920 --> 31:11.160
not a Bodhisattva.

31:11.160 --> 31:12.400
And I'm a notorious thief,

31:12.400 --> 31:13.680
not a walking saint.

31:14.310 --> 31:15.360
Look at me—

31:15.550 --> 31:17.790
do I look like a saint to you?

31:18.370 --> 31:19.510
Do I?

31:20.110 --> 31:20.750
If you don't do it,

31:20.750 --> 31:21.830
do you expect me to do it myself?

31:21.830 --> 31:22.720
If you want me to do it,

31:22.720 --> 31:23.550
then I'm charging more

31:23.550 --> 31:24.610
for the extra work.

31:24.880 --> 31:26.800
I'm famous, after all.

31:26.820 --> 31:28.310
I committed over ten major thefts

31:28.310 --> 31:29.960
in half a month,

31:30.150 --> 31:31.310
and now I'm here helping people

31:31.310 --> 31:32.710
look for their lost pets.

31:35.000 --> 31:36.260
What's with that look?

31:41.880 --> 31:42.480
Fine.

31:43.590 --> 31:44.400
Two years.

31:44.860 --> 31:45.830
You'll be free

31:46.870 --> 31:48.070
in two years.

31:48.700 --> 31:50.090
You'll let me go?

31:53.830 --> 31:55.160
Like hell I believe you.

32:28.310 --> 32:28.720
No offense,

32:28.720 --> 32:30.030
but the capital prefecture's office

32:30.030 --> 32:32.240
collects a fair bit
of tax money from the capital.

32:32.240 --> 32:33.770
Where did all that money go?

32:34.640 --> 32:36.440
Why is the food here so terrible?

32:39.510 --> 32:41.520
If you tell me every last thing

32:41.750 --> 32:43.400
you know about Nan Heng,

32:43.590 --> 32:45.160
forget about pig knuckles—

32:45.480 --> 32:47.940
you could have
a whole roast pig to yourself.

32:52.030 --> 32:53.030
We both know

32:53.640 --> 32:55.270
Nan Heng's been
supporting the Nightwalkers

32:55.270 --> 32:56.600
with ulterior motives.

32:56.790 --> 32:58.830
The fact that he left you in this cell

32:59.160 --> 33:00.640
means he's already abandoned you.

33:00.640 --> 33:02.490
Yet you'd still risk your life
to protect him.

33:02.490 --> 33:03.290
Why?

33:07.000 --> 33:08.000
General Chu,

33:09.100 --> 33:10.830
I'd like to make a deal with you.

33:11.570 --> 33:12.480
What deal?

33:14.110 --> 33:16.550
If you list out all the bad things

33:16.680 --> 33:18.540
Waning River Crescent has done,

33:18.750 --> 33:21.270
I'll tell you everything
about Nan Heng's collusion

33:21.270 --> 33:23.010
with the Nightwalkers.

33:23.440 --> 33:24.300
What do you say?

33:29.200 --> 33:30.880
You can't come up with anything?

33:30.880 --> 33:31.680
What's wrong?

33:31.920 --> 33:33.270
Aren't both Waning River Crescent

33:33.270 --> 33:36.260
and the Nightwalkers utterly
wicked in your eyes?

33:36.350 --> 33:37.270
It shouldn't be hard

33:37.270 --> 33:39.530
for you to list hundreds of their crimes.

33:43.110 --> 33:44.510
The Waning River Crescent case

33:44.510 --> 33:45.770
involves a lot of people.

33:45.770 --> 33:47.440
I need time to investigate.

33:47.440 --> 33:47.960
No problem.

33:47.960 --> 33:49.270
Take your time.

33:49.400 --> 33:50.770
If you can find even one crime,

33:50.770 --> 33:52.370
I'll cut off a finger myself.

33:59.920 --> 34:01.980
You ended up here because of Nan Heng,

34:02.160 --> 34:04.490
yet you still can't tell right from wrong.

34:10.110 --> 34:11.570
It was because of Nan Heng?

34:12.960 --> 34:15.760
Nan Heng didn't throw me
in this celestial prison.

34:16.590 --> 34:17.440
Mr. Chu,

34:17.840 --> 34:20.900
I ended up eating pig knuckles
down here because of you.

34:23.440 --> 34:24.590
We both know

34:25.510 --> 34:28.310
there's no good end
for anyone who trusts Nan Heng.

34:28.880 --> 34:30.239
I trusted him twice,

34:30.960 --> 34:32.960
and I lost my aunt and my father.

34:33.760 --> 34:34.590
This time,

34:35.670 --> 34:36.670
it's your turn.

34:37.440 --> 34:38.760
Have you looked into

34:39.280 --> 34:41.139
the Empress's death and the truth

34:41.630 --> 34:43.230
behind the Pingrong Battle?

34:43.360 --> 34:45.880
The late Empress
died during the autumn hunt.

34:45.880 --> 34:46.590
That day,

34:47.280 --> 34:48.880
it was Nan Heng who led my aunt

34:48.900 --> 34:50.630
to where the assassins were hiding.

34:50.630 --> 34:52.000
During the Pingrong Battle,

34:52.000 --> 34:53.710
I sent a letter asking the Xuanjia Army

34:53.710 --> 34:55.150
stationed in Youcheng for reinforcements.

34:55.150 --> 34:56.630
But even after the city gates
were breached

34:56.630 --> 34:59.430
and all 20,000 Qianyu soldiers
were slaughtered,

35:00.070 --> 35:01.730
Nan Heng still didn't show up.

35:03.760 --> 35:05.020
Have you ever asked him

35:05.550 --> 35:06.920
about these things?

35:06.920 --> 35:08.550
What killer

35:08.550 --> 35:09.920
ever admits to murder?

35:10.070 --> 35:11.920
But there are many truths

35:11.920 --> 35:13.280
that remain hidden.

35:13.710 --> 35:15.150
What you believe to be true

35:15.150 --> 35:16.750
might not be the truth at all.

35:18.710 --> 35:20.770
There's no kindness without reason,

35:20.880 --> 35:22.740
nor evil without cause.

35:26.630 --> 35:27.070
Fine.

35:27.880 --> 35:29.050
Then in your view,

35:29.440 --> 35:31.840
why did Nan Heng
run Waning River Crescent?

35:32.070 --> 35:33.590
Why did he take in

35:33.590 --> 35:35.670
fugitives like us
from the martial arts world?

35:35.670 --> 35:38.270
To secretly expand
his influence, obviously.

35:38.700 --> 35:41.360
He went to so much trouble
for bigger influence,

35:41.360 --> 35:43.360
but he gave away all the club's income

35:43.360 --> 35:45.110
for disaster relief.

35:45.400 --> 35:47.250
He even had us outlaws

35:47.400 --> 35:49.440
set up businesses in the west of the city

35:49.440 --> 35:51.700
so more displaced folks could find jobs.

35:52.110 --> 35:53.840
What's even more ridiculous is

35:54.070 --> 35:55.510
that a bunch of nobodies like us

35:55.510 --> 35:56.920
were forced to patrol

35:56.920 --> 35:58.590
the streets every night

35:58.590 --> 36:01.280
to keep the people safe in their sleep.

36:02.920 --> 36:03.840
Tell me,

36:04.230 --> 36:06.120
does this make any sense?

36:06.230 --> 36:07.960
Stop avoiding the real issues.

36:08.630 --> 36:09.840
Nan Heng did all that

36:10.190 --> 36:11.790
in order to seize the throne.

36:13.070 --> 36:14.320
As far as I know,

36:14.630 --> 36:16.480
after the Pingrong Battle was lost,

36:16.480 --> 36:18.000
you and that cousin prince of yours

36:18.000 --> 36:19.960
were no longer a match for Nan Heng.

36:21.190 --> 36:22.290
Nan Heng

36:22.670 --> 36:24.280
is just someone who's never been trusted

36:24.280 --> 36:25.670
by anyone.

36:27.430 --> 36:28.930
Maybe what he really wants

36:29.800 --> 36:31.260
is just a group of friends,

36:31.920 --> 36:32.670
a home,

36:34.210 --> 36:35.320
and the feeling that

36:35.320 --> 36:37.840
he's truly trusted.

36:40.510 --> 36:42.200
If I knew Nan Heng—

36:43.190 --> 36:44.510
I mean if I did,

36:45.070 --> 36:48.070
he absolutely wouldn't
be the kind of person you believe

36:48.070 --> 36:51.050
to have plotted
the late Empress's death at nine.

36:51.230 --> 36:52.710
And he definitely wouldn't be the type

36:52.710 --> 36:54.050
to sacrifice the Qianyu Army

36:54.050 --> 36:55.920
and lose our land to the enemy

36:56.110 --> 36:58.830
just to steal military merit.

36:59.210 --> 37:00.000
So,

37:00.710 --> 37:02.510
stop interrogating me already.

37:04.550 --> 37:06.480
I'm willing to die for my crime.

37:10.150 --> 37:11.550
Your crime?

37:13.670 --> 37:15.280
So you admit guilt?

37:17.920 --> 37:18.890
My crime

37:19.320 --> 37:21.450
is having failed to live it up

37:22.030 --> 37:24.030
as the cold-hearted Second Master.

37:27.250 --> 37:29.920
♪ No words can cage
a heart full of wounds ♪

37:30.740 --> 37:33.170
♪ I shake the heavens and plains
through the storm ♪

37:30.950 --> 37:34.720
[Three years ago]

37:32.510 --> 37:33.630
You went to all that trouble

37:33.630 --> 37:35.320
to get me off death row.

37:34.120 --> 37:37.270
♪ A promise is made,
and I don't fear death anymore ♪

37:36.150 --> 37:37.600
Tell me, Your Highness,

37:37.840 --> 37:40.270
what use am I to you?

37:38.340 --> 37:40.780
♪ Even dreams are pleasant ♪

37:40.470 --> 37:41.670
I looked into you.

37:42.590 --> 37:43.480
You're

37:43.550 --> 37:44.670
a thief

37:45.000 --> 37:46.190
and a lazy bum.

37:46.930 --> 37:49.260
You're also kind of a playboy.

37:49.480 --> 37:51.360
Did you save me just to humiliate me?

37:50.430 --> 37:52.430
♪ Beyond my control, powerless to resist ♪

37:52.670 --> 37:53.920
But you're great at management.

37:53.580 --> 37:55.920
♪ Yet still I dig deep, questioning fate ♪

37:54.320 --> 37:55.110
So,

37:55.480 --> 37:56.950
I plan to build

37:56.960 --> 38:00.120
♪ That is the meaning
behind my defiance ♪

37:57.070 --> 37:59.280
a club here called Waning River Crescent,

37:59.280 --> 38:00.800
and I want you to run it for me.

38:00.800 --> 38:02.410
The club is just a cover.

38:03.070 --> 38:05.720
What I really need you to do
is gather intel in the capital,

38:03.870 --> 38:06.320
♪ Even doomed for eternity,
I still have the courage ♪

38:06.000 --> 38:07.440
dig up secrets from officials,

38:07.370 --> 38:09.650
♪ For you, I'd step into the uncertainty ♪

38:08.030 --> 38:08.960
and build a force

38:08.960 --> 38:11.670
called the Nightwalkers for me.

38:10.690 --> 38:14.130
♪ If you believe in fate ♪

38:12.510 --> 38:13.320
Understand?

38:15.900 --> 38:18.500
♪ No words can cage
a heart full of wounds ♪

38:16.760 --> 38:18.350
That's truly dirty work.

38:18.670 --> 38:19.710
No problem.

38:19.450 --> 38:21.990
♪ I shake the heavens and plains
through the storm ♪

38:20.510 --> 38:22.960
But if you want me to do
all those dangerous things for you,

38:22.800 --> 38:26.260
♪ A promise is made,
and I don't fear death anymore ♪

38:22.990 --> 38:24.390
you'll have to pay extra.

38:24.530 --> 38:26.180
You want to haggle?

38:27.120 --> 38:28.810
♪ Even dreams are pleasant ♪

38:29.230 --> 38:30.070
Let me tell you,

38:29.820 --> 38:32.320
♪ Is it obsession, or chosen pain? ♪

38:31.040 --> 38:32.350
working for me

38:32.570 --> 38:34.560
is the only way you stay alive now.

38:33.410 --> 38:37.530
♪ Is it pride, with no shame? ♪

38:37.150 --> 38:38.400
And if I say no?

38:38.430 --> 38:41.800
♪ To give you a love
etched into the bones ♪

38:42.850 --> 38:44.560
♪ Then it's not something to grieve over♪

38:43.320 --> 38:44.450
Then I'm sure

38:45.230 --> 38:47.270
someone will be here tomorrow
to collect your corpse.

38:45.680 --> 38:49.920
♪ If tears are proof that I once loved ♪

38:52.150 --> 38:53.680
What if my identity is exposed?

38:52.190 --> 38:57.760
♪ If what's gone leaves behind
a trace of being ♪

38:57.430 --> 38:58.880
Take your own life.

38:59.950 --> 39:01.500
♪ Then let the tears fall ♪

39:02.440 --> 39:04.040
♪ Let me love you ♪

39:05.010 --> 39:10.460
♪ And fade away with one last dream ♪

39:07.470 --> 39:08.480
That makes sense.

39:08.510 --> 39:10.010
Why didn't I think of that?

39:10.050 --> 39:10.920
You're always the clever one,

39:10.920 --> 39:11.550
Chief,

39:11.550 --> 39:13.010
thinking of her right away.

39:13.010 --> 39:14.800
You'll also get to spend more time
with her

39:13.460 --> 39:16.280
♪ No words can cage
a heart full of wounds ♪

39:14.800 --> 39:15.840
while decoding those symbols.

39:15.840 --> 39:16.950
It's killing two birds with one stone.

39:16.910 --> 39:19.460
♪ I shake the heavens and plains
through the storm ♪

39:17.280 --> 39:19.360
Please spare Song Yimeng,

39:19.360 --> 39:21.150
and spare me too!

39:20.440 --> 39:23.510
♪ A promise is made,
and I don't fear death anymore ♪

39:21.400 --> 39:24.150
Why am I so unlucky?

39:24.560 --> 39:26.140
♪ Even dreams are pleasant ♪

39:26.440 --> 39:27.590
What are you looking at?

39:27.130 --> 39:30.510
♪ Is it obsession, or chosen pain? ♪

39:31.300 --> 39:35.430
♪ Is it pride, with no shame? ♪

39:36.310 --> 39:39.770
♪ To give you a love
etched into the bones ♪

39:40.630 --> 39:43.600
♪ Then it's not something to grieve over♪

40:36.070 --> 40:37.840
Whenever the female lead is in danger,

40:37.840 --> 40:39.150
the male lead has to save her.
